      "body": "## Overview\n\nAdds the missing GLM-5.3-Flash entry to the multimodal supported-models table.\n\nContext: #54062 was closed after GLM-5.3-Flash support landed in v0.30.0, but the supported-models table was not updated.\n\n## Claims\n\n- `Glm5NextForConditionalGeneration` is registered in\n  `vllm/model_executor/models/registry.py` and has been supported since\n  v0.30.0, but it was absent from `docs/models/supported_models.md`.\n- The new row lists the checkpoint and its image/video modalities, following\n  the adjacent GLM-4.1V / GLM-4.5V rows.\n\n## Validation\n\nDocs-only change; no code paths are touched.\n\n```text\npre-commit run --files docs/models/supported_models.md\n# typos, markdownlint-cli2 and the remaining applicable hooks passed\n```\n\nThe model code supports image and video through the inherited Glm4v\nmultimodal path (`Glm5NextForConditionalGeneration` registers\n`Glm5NextMultiModalProcessor` and accepts `{\"image\", \"video\"}` in its tower\nmodel). The sibling docs change in #63643 confirms the same model's\nimage/video support in the encoder CUDA-graph matrix.\n\n## Details\n\n- LoRA is left blank because general GLM-5.3-Flash LoRA support is still in\n  #56327; PP is marked supported via the inherited `SupportsPP` implementation.\n- The text-only `Glm5NextForCausalLM` entry is not listed separately, matching\n  the Qwen3.5 hybrid rows in this table; text-only mode is available through\n  the documented `--language-model-only` path.\n- No new CI test: this is a documentation row for an already-registered\n  architecture.\n\n## AI assistance\n\nAI assistance (opencode/DeepSeek) was used to prepare this docs change. The\nhuman submitter is responsible for the final review.\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary> Pull Request Checklist </summary>\n\n- [x] I used vLLM's `/pr-checklist` skill. (Mandatory for agents, optional for humans).\n- [x] AI assistance was used during the creation of this PR.\n\n- [x] **Design Fit:** Docs-only, reuses the existing supported-models table format.\n- [x] **Testing and Validation:** Applicable hooks pass; capability is verified against the model registration and inherited multimodal path.\n- [x] **Code Quality and Style:** `typos` and `markdownlint-cli2` pass.\n- [x] **Pull Request Contents:** Summary, evidence, and scope are included.\n</details>\n",
