xisting supported-models table format.\n- [x] **Testing and Validation:** Applicable hooks pass; capability is verified against the model registration and inherited multimodal path.\n- [x] **Code Quality and Style:** `typos` and `markdownlint-cli2` pass.\n- [x] **Pull Request Contents:** Summary, evidence, and scope are included.\n</details>\n",
